Medical Dictionary Premium:-

Medical Dictionary Premium  is for medical practitioners and students to look up the definitions and technical terms in a second. Medical Dictionary Offline is designed for medical students, helping them in their studies.


This best-selling and market-leading dictionary contains over 20,000 clear and concise entries, covering all aspects of medical science. Written by a team of medical experts, the entries are accessible and jargon-free, and complemented by over 500 illustrations and diagrams. Medical Terms and Dictionary with common and uncommon words, terms and phrases. Used by healthcare professionals, pharmaceuticals, physicians, hospital nurses, medical students, nursing professionals, pharmacy, physician assistants and for students who work in clinical practice & dispensary.

The 8th edition has been fully revised and updated to cover changes in this fast-moving field. Entries on techniques and equipment, drugs, general medical practice, health service organization, and treatment have all been reviewed, and updated where necessary.



